{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Payslips\">Payslips</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Automatic Is On Payslip Payslips Pending RecurringPayslip RecurringPayslips To ToDate\">The <strong>Pending Recurring Payslips</strong> screen displays payslips that are scheduled for automatic creation based on your recurring payroll schedules.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Adjustments And Automatic Is Payslip Payslips Rate To ToDate View\">This screen helps you review and manage upcoming payslips before they are automatically generated, ensuring accuracy and allowing you to make any necessary adjustments.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Automatic Create Date On Payslip Payslips Rate RecurringPayslip Sent To ToDate\">Each row in the table represents a recurring payslip that will be created on its scheduled date. The system will automatically generate these payslips based on the recurring templates you have set up.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NextIssueDate\">Next issue date</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NextIssueDate\">Next issue date</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Automatic Date Is On Payslip Rate RecurringPayslip Settings To ToDate\">Shows the scheduled date when this recurring payslip will be automatically generated. This date is calculated based on your recurring payslip settings.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Employee\">Employee</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Employee\">Employee</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Employee Is Name On Payslip Settings\">Shows the name of the employee who will receive this payslip. The employee name is displayed in the format configured in your employee settings.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Description Is On Other Payslip RecurringPayslip Reference\">Shows the description or reference for this payslip. This typically includes the pay period or other identifying information you have entered in the recurring payslip template.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"GrossPay\">Gross pay</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"GrossPay\">Gross pay</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount Deduction Deductions Earnings Employee GrossPay Is On To ToDate Total\">Shows the total <em>gross pay</em> amount before any deductions are applied. This is the employee's total earnings for the pay period.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Earnings GrossPay Is On Other Payslip\">The <em>gross pay</em> includes all earnings such as regular wages, overtime pay, bonuses, commissions, and any other compensation configured in the payslip template.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Deduction\">Deduction</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Deduction\">Deduction</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount Deduction Deductions Employee From FromDate GrossPay On To ToDate Total\">Shows the total amount of deductions that will be subtracted from the employee's <em>gross pay</em>.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Contribution Contributions Deduction Deductions Income On Other Payslip Tax\">Deductions typically include income tax withholdings, social security contributions, health insurance premiums, retirement plan contributions, and any other withholdings configured in the payslip template.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NetPay\">Net pay</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NetPay\">Net pay</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Actual Amount Deduction Deductions Employee Net NetPay On\">Shows the <em>net pay</em> amount that the employee will actually receive after all deductions have been applied.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Actual Amount Automatic Deduction Deductions Employee GrossPay Is Net NetPay On Paid To ToDate Total TotalDeductions\">The <em>net pay</em> is calculated automatically as <em>gross pay</em> minus total deductions. This is the actual amount that will be paid to the employee.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Contribution\">Contribution</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Contribution\">Contribution</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount Contribution Contributions Employee EmployerContribution On To ToDate Total\">Shows the total amount of employer contributions that will be made on behalf of the employee.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Add Amount And By Contribution Contributions Employee EmployerContribution Net NetPay On Other Paid PaidBy Port Sent To ToDate\">Employer contributions are amounts paid by the employer in addition to the employee's wages. These typically include employer-paid portions of retirement plans, health insurance, workers' compensation, and other benefits. These amounts do not affect the employee's <em>net pay</em> but represent additional costs to the employer.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "pending-recurring-payslips"
}
